        "TileImage": "$($repository e360ed3a-3cdf-40c9-b503-0385898ba5c3).Image",
        "Description": "Good morning, 47.\r\rYour target is Mike Hull (née Westen), former spy. Blacklisted circa 2007, Hull was exiled to Miami where, after continuing to make trouble for his benefactors, he was thrown from a helicopter, presumed dead. He has resurfaced, however, now working private security. His former employers have contracted the ICA to remove this liability--permanently. \rHull was recently spotted purchasing forged travel documents, so time is of the essence--make sure he&apos;s not going anywhere.",
